# What’s New (in-app)

The dialog is **3–6 feature-benefit bullets**. Each line: what shipped + why it helps.

GitHub Releases may keep pack/signing/hardware detail for humans. **Do not** put that wall of text in the app. Prefer `BUNDLED_BY_VERSION` in `src/core/whatsNew.ts`. If pending or GitHub notes are used, sanitize to feature bullets; drop Pack/Mac/Windows/Site headings and installer copy.

## Include

- Strike last sentence in the dictation box — keep the line visible, leave it out of the manuscript
- Less silence junk (“no, no”) without eating the next sentence

## Exclude

- Notarization, stapler, DMGs, NSIS, `latest.yml`, Intel vs Apple Silicon models, build numbers as the story

A small “Version 0.1.9” title is fine. Keep dismiss, first-install vs upgrade, and the pending notes file for detection — not as raw GitHub copy.
